Peron15 Delta Wing UAV - JSBSim Model for ArduPilot SITL
========================================================

FLIGHT-VALIDATED MODEL
This model has been tuned using real flight data from dataflash log 00000030.BIN
(Flight date: September 27, 2025)

Aircraft Specifications
-----------------------
Wingspan:        154 cm (5.05 ft)
Wing Area:       7779.5 cm^2 (8.375 ft^2)
Mean Chord:      63.25 cm (2.075 ft)
MAC:             60.78 cm (1.994 ft)
Aspect Ratio:    3.05
Weight:          7.46 kg (16.45 lbs) - FLIGHT VALIDATED

Configuration
-------------
- Delta wing planform
- Elevon control (combined elevator/aileron, no rudder)
- Electric pusher motor at rear

Propulsion
----------
Motor:           T-MOTOR AT4130 KV450
Power:           ~1700W mechanical
Propeller:       MasterAirScrew Electric 13x8.5
Static Thrust:   5-6 kg (STATED)

Mass Properties (from CAD)
--------------------------
Ixx:             0.2994 kg*m^2 (roll)
Iyy:             0.8629 kg*m^2 (pitch)
Izz:             1.1520 kg*m^2 (yaw)

Flight-Validated Performance
----------------------------
Cruise Speed:    24 m/s at 55-60% throttle (MEASURED - log 21)
Max Airspeed:    63.5 m/s (MEASURED)
Max Roll Rate:   ~300 deg/s (MEASURED capability)
Max Pitch Rate:  ~145 deg/s (MEASURED in AUTO mode)
Glide Speed:     ~22 m/s at idle throttle (MEASURED)

ArduPilot Parameters Used
-------------------------
SCALING_SPEED:      24.0 m/s
TRIM_THROTTLE:      55%
MIXING_GAIN:        0.5
RLL2SRV_RMAX:       120 deg/s
PTCH2SRV_RMAX_UP:   120 deg/s
PTCH2SRV_RMAX_DN:   120 deg/s
RLL_RATE_FF:        0.27
PTCH_RATE_FF:       0.55

Flight-Validated Stability Derivatives
--------------------------------------
From analysis of AUTO mode flight data:

Roll Control (Clda):
  - Roll rate at 24 m/s: ~252 deg/s per unit command
  - Estimated Clda: 0.16 (validated from ~231 deg/s overall)

Pitch Control (Cmde):
  - Pitch rate at 24 m/s: ~117 deg/s per unit command
  - Estimated |Cmde|: 0.61-0.80

Flight Notes from Log Analysis
------------------------------
- GUIDED mode produced dive maneuvers (pitch rates to -394 deg/s)
- AUTO mode showed normal flight envelope
- FBWA mode showed stable manual-assisted flight
- Roll authority confirmed up to 180 degree bank angles
- Full aerobatic capability demonstrated

Files
-----
Peron15.xml              - Main JSBSim flight dynamics model
Peron15-JSBSim-set.xml   - FlightGear integration
Engines/TMOTOR_AT4130.xml - Electric motor (1700W)
Engines/MAS_13x8.5.xml   - Propeller (tuned for 5-6kg thrust)
Systems/                 - Autopilot, electrical, scripts

Usage with ArduPilot SITL
-------------------------
1. The model is configured for flying wing with elevons
2. ArduPilot should have MIXING_GAIN=0.5 for elevon mixing
3. Servo functions: Ch1=Left Elevon (77), Ch2=Right Elevon (78)
4. No rudder channel needed

